{
  "id": "E259",
  "title": "What Are You Doing After Work?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-09-19",
  "synopsis": "Little Zhang has a few different suggestions for things to do after work.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/844/5a67fd2a811f0fd378a8f0741834de9d7e684036.mp3?1536666392",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你下班后打算做什么？\n\n小张：你下班后打算做什么？\n小王：还没有安排，你想做什么？\n小张：要不我们去KTV唱歌吧。\n小王：就我们两个人去唱歌没意思啊。\n小张：那去攀岩，怎么样？\n小王：太累了！工作了一整天，没有力气攀岩了。\n小张：其实我也挺累的。要不我们去按摩吧。\n小王：这个听起来不错，我们去好好放松一下。\n小张：按摩完了再去吃火锅。\n小王：太好了！我早就想吃火锅了。",
    "traditional": "你下班後打算做什麼？\n\n小張：你下班後打算做什麼？\n小王：還沒有安排，你想做什麼？\n小張：要不我們去KTV唱歌吧。\n小王：就我們兩個人去唱歌沒意思啊。\n小張：那去攀岩，怎麼樣？\n小王：太累了！工作了一整天，沒有力氣攀岩了。\n小張：其實我也挺累的。要不我們去按摩吧。\n小王：這個聽起來不錯，我們去好好放鬆一下。\n小張：按摩完了再去吃火鍋。\n小王：太好了！我早就想吃火鍋了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What Are You Doing After Work?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：你下班后打算做什么？",
      "traditional": "小張：你下班後打算做什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng nǐ xià bān hòu dǎ suàn zuò shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: What are you doing after work?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小王：还没有安排，你想做什么？",
      "traditional": "小王：還沒有安排，你想做什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng hái méi yǒu ān pái nǐ xiǎng zuò shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Wang: I don’t have any plans yet. What do you want to do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：要不我们去KTV唱歌吧。",
      "traditional": "小張：要不我們去KTV唱歌吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng yào bù wǒ men qù K T V chàng gē ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: How about going to KTV to sing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小王：就我们两个人去唱歌没意思啊。",
      "traditional": "小王：就我們兩個人去唱歌沒意思啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng jiù wǒ men liǎng ge rén qù chàng gē méi yì si a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Wang: Going just the two of us to sing KTV is boring."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：那去攀岩，怎么样？",
      "traditional": "小張：那去攀岩，怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng nà qù pān yán zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: How about rock climbing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小王：太累了！工作了一整天，没有力气攀岩了。",
      "traditional": "小王：太累了！工作了一整天，沒有力氣攀岩了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng tài lèi le gōng zuò le yì zhěng tiān méi yǒu lì qi pān yán le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Wang: I’m really tired! I don’t have the energy to climb after a long day at work."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小张：其实我也挺累的。要不我们去按摩吧。",
      "traditional": "小張：其實我也挺累的。要不我們去按摩吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng qí shí wǒ yě tǐng lèi de yào bù wǒ men qù àn mó ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I’m actually also quite tired. How about we go for a massage?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小王：这个听起来不错，我们去好好放松一下。",
      "traditional": "小王：這個聽起來不錯，我們去好好放鬆一下。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng zhè ge tīng qi lai bú cuò wǒ men qù hǎo hǎo fàng sōng yí xià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Wang: That sounds pretty good. Let’s relax a bit."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小张：按摩完了再去吃火锅。",
      "traditional": "小張：按摩完了再去吃火鍋。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng àn mó wán le zài qù chī huǒ guō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: We can eat hot pot after the massage."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "小王：太好了！我早就想吃火锅了。",
      "traditional": "小王：太好了！我早就想吃火鍋了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng tài hǎo le wǒ zǎo jiù xiǎng chī huǒ guō le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Wang: Great! I have wanted to eat hot pot for a long time."
    }
  ],
